rows.en:
What, I'm in the way...?
...Why is that?
I feel like someone said something like that to me before.{p}

When I screamed, it slid back into her mouth as if startled.
In an instant, a cold silence closed in around us.
But...{p}

"...Yeah."
Hosoda answered with a little nod.
The interview was complete...{p}

I stood still right where I was and didn't move.
...And yet the light, which had been like a dot at first, kept growing bigger and bigger.
I'm being drawn in...★{p}

...What on earth is wrong with this person's taste buds?
Whether or not he noticed me staring at him, full of suspicion and doubt...
the man just went on elegantly drinking his tea.{p}

"Me too!
I want some too...☆"
No sooner had Hosoda shouted than he tried to forcibly snatch the cup out of my hands.{p}

The cup left my hand and in an instant was falling to the hard floor...
Crash...☆
With a grating sound, white shards and blackish liquid went flying.{p}

Back then...
Hosoda was in the way, so we just left the broken cup there and went home.
That tea... most of it spilled, but a little might have been left on the shards.{p}

"Hosoda...
This is what happens when you go and lick just a little of it."
With that, Takeuchi threw the window blinds wide open.{p}

"Waah!
St-stop it, pleeease!"
On top of the wailing Hosoda's head, lush green leaves were swaying.{p}
